{"version":"https://jsonfeed.org/version/1.1","title":"AES-CBC - Tag | ꜱᴘᴀᴡɴ𝟐ᴘᴡɴ","description":"Personal CTF writeups and cybersecurity notes.","home_page_url":"https://ctf.spawn2pwn.my.id/","language":"en","icon":"https://ctf.spawn2pwn.my.id/apple-touch-icon.png","favicon":"https://ctf.spawn2pwn.my.id/favicon.ico","authors":[{"name":"spawn2pwn","url":"https://github.com/nfl-alvis","avatar":"https://ctf.spawn2pwn.my.id/images/IdaWin.png"}],"items":[{"title":"Kurva Patah","date_published":"2026-04-08T00:00:00&#43;07:00","date_modified":"2026-11-04T17:00:28&#43;07:00","id":"https://ctf.spawn2pwn.my.id/posts/kurva-patah/","url":"https://ctf.spawn2pwn.my.id/posts/kurva-patah/","authors":[{"name":"spawn2pwn","url":"https://github.com/nfl-alvis","avatar":"https://www.gravatar.com/avatar/b01c9af4b33ead25b072a03f8d0c5508?s=32&amp;d=mp"}],"tags":["ECDH","Discrete Logarithm","Small Order Attack","AES-CBC"],"summary":" Intercepted elliptic curve Diffie-Hellman parameters were recovered. Can you break the discrete logarithm on this flawed curve and decrypt the secret transmission?\nTL;DR Kurva Patah is a cryptography challenge featuring a vulnerable Elliptic Curve Diffie-Hellman (ECDH) implementation. Because the curve\u0026rsquo;s group order is exceptionally small (n=10092n = 10092n=10092), the Elliptic Curve Discrete Logarithm Problem (ECDLP) is trivial to solve via direct point multiplication brute force. Once the target\u0026rsquo;s private key ddd is recovered, the AES-128-CBC key is derived from SHA-256(str(d))[:16]\\text{SHA-256}(\\text{str}(d))[:16]SHA-256(str(d))[:16], decrypting the flag ciphertext. Intercepted Parameters The challenge provides intercepted transmission parameters in intercept.json:\n","content_html":"\u003cblockquote\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIntercepted elliptic curve Diffie-Hellman parameters were recovered. Can you break the discrete logarithm on this flawed curve and decrypt the secret transmission?\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/blockquote\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"details admonition abstract open\"\u003e\n    \u003cdiv class=\"details-summary admonition-title\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"icon fa-solid fa-clipboard-list\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003c/i\u003eTL;DR\u003ci class=\"details-icon fa-solid fa-angle-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"details-content\"\u003e\n      \u003cdiv class=\"admonition-content\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eKurva Patah\u003c/strong\u003e is a cryptography challenge featuring a vulnerable Elliptic Curve Diffie-Hellman (ECDH) implementation. Because the curve\u0026rsquo;s group order is exceptionally small (\u003cspan class=\"katex\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"katex-mathml\"\u003e\u003cmath xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"\u003e\u003csemantics\u003e\u003cmrow\u003e\u003cmi\u003en\u003c/mi\u003e\u003cmo\u003e=\u003c/mo\u003e\u003cmn\u003e10092\u003c/mn\u003e\u003c/mrow\u003e\u003cannotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\"\u003en = 10092\u003c/annotation\u003e\u003c/semantics\u003e\u003c/math\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"katex-base\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"mord mathnormal\"\u003en\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"mrel\"\u003e=\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"katex-base\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"mord\"\u003e10092\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e), the Elliptic Curve Discrete Logarithm Problem (ECDLP) is trivial to solve via direct point multiplication brute force. Once the target\u0026rsquo;s private key \u003cspan class=\"katex\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"katex-mathml\"\u003e\u003cmath xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"\u003e\u003csemantics\u003e\u003cmrow\u003e\u003cmi\u003ed\u003c/mi\u003e\u003c/mrow\u003e\u003cannotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\"\u003ed\u003c/annotation\u003e\u003c/semantics\u003e\u003c/math\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"katex-base\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"mord mathnormal\"\u003ed\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e is recovered, the AES-128-CBC key is derived from \u003cspan class=\"katex\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"katex-mathml\"\u003e\u003cmath xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"\u003e\u003csemantics\u003e\u003cmrow\u003e\u003cmtext\u003eSHA-256\u003c/mtext\u003e\u003cmo stretchy=\"false\"\u003e(\u003c/mo\u003e\u003cmtext\u003estr\u003c/mtext\u003e\u003cmo stretchy=\"false\"\u003e(\u003c/mo\u003e\u003cmi\u003ed\u003c/mi\u003e\u003cmo stretchy=\"false\"\u003e)\u003c/mo\u003e\u003cmo stretchy=\"false\"\u003e)\u003c/mo\u003e\u003cmo stretchy=\"false\"\u003e[\u003c/mo\u003e\u003cmo\u003e:\u003c/mo\u003e\u003cmn\u003e16\u003c/mn\u003e\u003cmo stretchy=\"false\"\u003e]\u003c/mo\u003e\u003c/mrow\u003e\u003cannotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\"\u003e\\text{SHA-256}(\\text{str}(d))[:16]\u003c/annotation\u003e\u003c/semantics\u003e\u003c/math\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"katex-base\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"mord text\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"mord\"\u003eSHA-256\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"mopen\"\u003e(\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"mord text\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"mord\"\u003estr\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"mopen\"\u003e(\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"mord mathnormal\"\u003ed\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"mclose\"\u003e))\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"mopen\"\u003e[\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"mrel\"\u003e:\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"katex-base\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"mord\"\u003e16\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"mclose\"\u003e]\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e, decrypting the flag ciphertext.\u003c/div\u003e\n    \u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003ch2 class=\"heading-element\" id=\"intercepted-parameters\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eIntercepted Parameters\u003c/span\u003e\n  \u003ca href=\"#intercepted-parameters\" class=\"heading-mark\"\u003e\n    \u003csvg class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cpath d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"\u003e\u003c/path\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\n  \u003c/a\u003e\n\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe challenge provides intercepted transmission parameters in \u003ccode\u003eintercept.json\u003c/code\u003e:\u003c/p\u003e"}]}